sdata> -- REPL parity companion to unset_held_error.cmd.
sdata> NEW
sdata> USE MOCK
Generating mock data...
sdata> HOLD SUMVAL
sdata> LET SUMVAL = 1
sdata> UNSET SUMVAL
Error: UNSET cannot remove "SUMVAL": it is a permanent variable; use DROP "SUMVAL" (effective after the next RUN) to remove it
sdata> PRINT SUMVAL
sdata> RUN
1.00000
1.00000
1.00000
RUN complete. 3 records and 4 variables processed.
sdata> QUIT
